Subject: [PATCH] [3.8] gh-156793: Validate SSLContext.wrap_bio() parameters
 like wrap_socket() (CVE-2026-19553)

---
 Doc/library/asyncio-eventloop.rst      |  4 ++
 Doc/library/ssl.rst                    | 13 +++-
 Lib/asyncio/sslproto.py                | 11 +++
 Lib/ssl.py                             | 27 +++++---
 4 files changed

diff --git a/Doc/library/asyncio-eventloop.rst b/Doc/library/asyncio-eventloop.rst
index dde57e2..276c90e 100644
--- a/Doc/library/asyncio-eventloop.rst
+++ b/Doc/library/asyncio-eventloop.rst
@@ -463,6 +463,10 @@ Opening network connections
 
       Added support for SSL/TLS in :class:`ProactorEventLoop`.
 
+   .. versionchanged:: next
+      Raises a ``ValueError`` if ``ssl.check_hostname`` is ``True``
